References
----------
ZoreWars is an independent implementation of the ICWS'94 draft standard for
Redcode. It contains no code from pMARS; pMARS (GPL-2.0-or-later) is used only
as an external program to check compatibility (see COMPLIANCE.md). The
position generator implements the published Park-Miller "minimal standard"
algorithm (Communications of the ACM 31:10, 1988).
